## Purpose
Qualify bank/full-service API data routes and their differing exchange coverage.

## Tasks
- [ ] ICICI Breeze: NSE-only documented boundary, history, signed session auth and quotas.
- [ ] Kotak Neo: official SDK/docs, historical versus quote support, TOTP/session and coverage.
- [ ] 5paisa Xstream: candle history windows, OAuth, plan costs and adjustments.
- [ ] IIFL Capital: current official API generation, history product and entitlement.
- [ ] Complete common qualification and separate go/no-go for all four candidates.

## Acceptance criteria
- Breeze is not represented as a documented BSE solution.
- JS portal availability alone is not historical-data capability evidence.

## Completion evidence
